  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <p><br><ruby>今日<rt>きょう</rt></ruby>もありがとう♡<br><br><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_0.jpg\"><br><br>ブログも<ruby>開<rt>ひら</rt></ruby>いてくれてありがとう！<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_1.jpg\">　<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_2.jpg\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_3.jpg\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_4.jpg\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_5.jpg\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_6.jpg\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_7.jpg\">　<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/takeuchi.kirari/2025-03-01/59174_8.jpg\"><br><br><br><br>そして、<br><ruby>舞台<rt>ぶたい</rt></ruby>『<ruby>五<rt>ご</rt></ruby><ruby>等分<rt>とうぶん</rt></ruby>の<ruby>花嫁<rt>はなよめ</rt></ruby>』ももうすぐで<ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>まるね💐<br><ruby>今<rt>いま</rt></ruby>、<ruby>一生懸命<rt>いっしょうけんめい</rt></ruby><ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>ってます！<br>ぜひ<ruby>一緒<rt>いっしょ</rt></ruby>に<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しんで<ruby>頂<rt>いただ</rt></ruby>けたら<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです。<br><br><ruby>一緒<rt>いっしょ</rt></ruby>にトキメキしよ！</p>\n                    ",
